Looking at this problem, I need to determine whether analyticity and boundedness of G in the open upper half-plane C⁺ implies boundedness on the real line R with no poles.

**Answer Leak Check:** The problem text contains no leaked answers, solutions, or solution sketches. Proceeding to solve.

